        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 24th Hong Kong Film Awards\n- Films: 2046, Kung Fu Hustle\n- People: Wong Kar-wai, Stephen Chow, Raymond Wong\n- Roles: director, composer\n\nFacts:\n- The 24th Hong Kong Film Awards unveiled twenty-nine winners in nineteen categories.\n- At the 24th Hong Kong Film Awards, Kung Fu Hustle and 2046 were the year's biggest winners.\n- 2046 is a 2004 Hong Kong romantic drama film written and directed by Wong Kar-wai.\n- Kung Fu Hustle is a 2004 martial arts film directed by Stephen Chow.\n- Raymond Wong composed the score for Kung Fu Hustle.\n- Raymond Wong's score for Kung Fu Hustle was nominated for Best Original Film Score at the 24th Hong Kong Film Awards.",
